1
00:00:12,312 --> 00:00:17,564
Tu vois, ce quartier a beaucoup changé depuis mon enfance.
You see, this neighbourhood has changed a lot since my childhood.

2
00:00:17,664 --> 00:00:22,892
Ah oui ? Il était comment, à l'époque ?
Oh yes? What was it like back then?

3
00:00:22,992 --> 00:00:31,892
Il y avait des petits commerces partout. Maintenant, il y a de plus en plus de cafés et de moins en moins de boutiques.
There were small shops everywhere. Now there are more and more cafés and fewer and fewer shops.

4
00:00:31,992 --> 00:00:35,780
Le centre est devenu très touristique.
The centre has become very touristy.

5
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:44,684
Oui. Autrefois, on connaissait tous ses voisins. Désormais, on ne se parle presque plus.
Yes. In the past, you knew all your neighbours. Nowadays, we hardly talk to each other any more.

6
00:00:44,784 --> 00:00:50,036
C'est dommage, mais la ville est devenue plus propre et plus calme.
It's a pity, but the city has become cleaner and quieter.
